{"title":"Career Roadmap · Automation Engineer","role":"Automation Engineer","summary":"An Automation Engineer designs, programs, integrates, commissions, and maintains automated industrial systems. The role combines mechanical systems, electrical/electronics, PLC programming, sensors, industrial networks, robotics, motion control, and software.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. — Engineering & Technology","Course":"Mechanical Engineering (Smart Mechanical / Mechatronics & Automation)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Automation Engineer designs, programs, integrates, commissions, and maintains automated industrial systems. The role combines mechanical systems, electrical/electronics, PLC programming, sensors, industrial networks, robotics, motion control, and software."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Designing automated production systems"},{"text":"Programming PLCs and HMIs"},{"text":"Integrating sensors and actuators"},{"text":"Developing machine-control logic"},{"text":"Configuring industrial robots"},{"text":"Troubleshooting automation equipment"},{"text":"Commissioning machines at production sites"},{"text":"Monitoring machine performance"},{"text":"Implementing Industrial IoT solutions"},{"text":"Improving production efficiency and reducing downtime"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a Smart Mechanical / Mechatronics & Automation specialization, this is a directly aligned career path."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / B.E.","Automation / Controls Intern","Automation Engineer","Controls / Robotics Engineer","Senior Automation Engineer","Automation Lead / Controls Lead","Automation Architect / Engineering Manager","Industrial Automation Consultant"]},{"type":"table","header":["Experience","Possible Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–1 year"},{"text":"Automati