 curtains"},{"text":"Safety scanners"},{"text":"Guarding"},{"text":"Lockout/tagout concepts"},{"text":"Risk assessment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant standards/frameworks may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IEC 61508"},{"text":"ISO 13849"},{"text":"IEC 62061"},{"text":"Machinery safety requirements applicable to the region"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact compliance requirements depend on the machine, industry, and jurisdiction."}]},{"heading":"Major Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Automated Conveyor System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simulated or physical system containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conveyor"},{"text":"Sensors"},{"text":"Motor"},{"text":"PLC"},{"text":"HMI"},{"text":"Emergency stop"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Control logic:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Object Detected","Sensor","PLC","Motor ON","Object Reaches Station","Motor OFF","Actuator Operation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Automatic Sorting System"},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conveyor"},{"text":"Proximity/color sensor"},{"text":"PLC"},{"text":"Pneumatic actuator"},{"text":"HMI"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Object","Sensor","Classification","PLC","Pneumatic Actuator","Correct Bin"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Robotic Pick-and-Place"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a robotic cell that:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"detects objects"},{"text":"identifies position"},{"text":"picks them"},{"text":"moves them"},{"text":"places them into predefined locations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Include robot simulation if physical hardware is unavailable."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Predictive Maintenance System"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"vibration sensor"},{"text":"temperature sensor"},{"text":"PLC/edge device"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"ML model"},{"text":"dashboard"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Machine","Sensors","Edge Device","Data Collection","ML Model","Anomaly Det